    opx:sourceReference "The exact-match Page One profile names the Devil Fruit as リュウリュウの実 古代種 モデル 〝スピノサウルス〟; the ontology uses a named individual for each modeled fruit." ;
    opx:confidence "high" ; opx:temporalScope "identity; time-independent" .

